                                                "sense_id": "54329646-d76c-3f87-be45-b7bb84381bdd",
                                                "text": "But a hare that is hoar / Is too much for a score / When it hoars ere it be spent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
